  "description": "A lightweight aluminum frame with a low stand-over height, 24-inch wheels and fun colors make Flourish an exceptional riding companion for the neighborhood and beyond. Compatible for adding on a rack to make carrying supplies easy, and fenders to keep road debris and puddles away. Easy to use hand brake levers provide secure rim braking making Flourish the perfect solution to get kids feeling excited to ride and cruise around the neighborhood or parks. This package deal includes many perks for fun and safety, including a protective chainguard that keeps clothing from snagging in the drivetrain, a kickstand for easy parking, a bell, and dedicated youth components for a perfect fit.",
